        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.85, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>说一句话，它就帮你把提醒设好，<br />到点用弹窗把人从屏幕前拉开。</Text>
